# Binary assets — never apply line-ending or encoding conversion.
# Rationale: two agents edit this worktree; a silently mangled .docx or .png
# is unrecoverable in review. See W0.1 command list §4.
*.docx  binary
*.doc    binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.gif   binary
*.pt    binary
*.pth   binary
*.npy   binary
*.npz   binary
*.pyc   binary
